(6206874, 914571, 83313, '<td valign="top">A darn good shot, but a couple of nitpicks that keep it from being a great one for me. <br/>-Seems cropped a little too tight top and bottom.<br/>-A little too strong in the foliage with the dayglo color. Desaturating the yellows would give it a more realistic appearance.<br/> <br/>I would say my nitpicks fall into the personal preferences category, as I don''t feel they will be major issues that will hold this back and I expect it to do well.</td>', 'A darn good shot, but a couple of nitpicks that keep it from being a great one for me. -Seems cropped a little too tight top and bottom.-A little too strong in the foliage with the dayglo color. Desaturating the yellows would give it a more realistic appearance. I would say my nitpicks fall into the personal preferences category, as I don''t feel they will be major issues that will hold this back and I expect it to do well.', '2010-11-01 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
