(6207230, 916226, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image, and I like that you can even see the exhaust stuff (whatever this is)<br/>Despite the fact that the planes themselves are in an interesting position, this image comes off as slightly boring to me. I think its mainly the composition. It is just off center enough to be noticeable and unbalance the picture, but not off center enough to make an interesting composition.<br/>You exposed this image perfectly though, and honestly considering the lighting conditions you pretty much captured it as perfectly as you were going to get under the conditions. 6</td>', 'Nice sharp image, and I like that you can even see the exhaust stuff (whatever this is)Despite the fact that the planes themselves are in an interesting position, this image comes off as slightly boring to me. I think its mainly the composition. It is just off center enough to be noticeable and unbalance the picture, but not off center enough to make an interesting composition.You exposed this image perfectly though, and honestly considering the lighting conditions you pretty much captured it as perfectly as you were going to get under the conditions. 6', '2010-11-01 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6207234, 916772, 115307, '<td valign="top">Love this! The composition is beyond perfect. My eyes follow the water rising up, and then crash down with the surfer in a never ending loop. I could stare at this picture for a very long time. Also great expression captured! 8</td>', 'Love this! The composition is beyond perfect. My eyes follow the water rising up, and then crash down with the surfer in a never ending loop. I could stare at this picture for a very long time. Also great expression captured! 8', '2010-11-01 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6207237, 913972, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice moody photograph, and I do like the greenish tinge to the picture that gives it a little more atmosphere. However, I do think it comes off a bit too strong. Maybe slightly less greenish tinge would have made it more effective. 7</td>', 'Nice moody photograph, and I do like the greenish tinge to the picture that gives it a little more atmosphere. However, I do think it comes off a bit too strong. Maybe slightly less greenish tinge would have made it more effective. 7', '2010-11-01 16:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
