(6207260, 916587, 115307, '<td valign="top">I personally like this photograph better than your "Jump" entry. The feel is much more serene, and I like the space between her hand and foot that exists here but not in the other. I would like to see the background be somewhat darker though, since it is so light it draws some attention away from your subject.<br/>Lovely photograph with awesome composition 8</td>', 'I personally like this photograph better than your "Jump" entry. The feel is much more serene, and I like the space between her hand and foot that exists here but not in the other. I would like to see the background be somewhat darker though, since it is so light it draws some attention away from your subject.Lovely photograph with awesome composition 8', '2010-11-01 16:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
