(6208557, 912804, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yuuummmmmm</td>', 'Yuuummmmmm', '2010-11-02 12:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208559, 916933, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is such a great quality to this image.  I love exploring all the tiny, surprising and gratifying treats: the star-flare trio of lights, the tromp l''oeil art on the wall, all the nooks and crannies.  Fun!</td>', 'There is such a great quality to this image.  I love exploring all the tiny, surprising and gratifying treats: the star-flare trio of lights, the tromp l''oeil art on the wall, all the nooks and crannies.  Fun!', '2010-11-02 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208560, 916076, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stupendous.  We don''t get this kind of wind around here...</td>', 'Stupendous.  We don''t get this kind of wind around here...', '2010-11-02 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208579, 915382, 96751, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing.  He looks like a miniature because the microphone stand is so very tall compared to him.  At first I thought it was just a matter of perspective, but that base is only  a couple of feet from him, so I''m mystified as to why it is SO high up.  Everything else is classic and gorgeous.</td>', 'Quite intriguing.  He looks like a miniature because the microphone stand is so very tall compared to him.  At first I thought it was just a matter of perspective, but that base is only  a couple of feet from him, so I''m mystified as to why it is SO high up.  Everything else is classic and gorgeous.', '2010-11-02 12:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208580, 917022, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice product shot!</td>', 'Nice product shot!', '2010-11-02 12:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
