(6211228, 917485, 94241, '<td valign="top">I think if this was cropped in, you could make a stronger composition.  I''d probably try to cut the big foreground boulder out completely; it feels like a distraction from the beauty of the tree and water.</td>', 'I think if this was cropped in, you could make a stronger composition.  I''d probably try to cut the big foreground boulder out completely; it feels like a distraction from the beauty of the tree and water.', '2010-11-04 04:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
