(6211232, 913214, 94241, '<td valign="top">I feel this has a little too much foreground, it grabs the attention and says "hey I''m important" and takes away from the beautiful stuff behind it.  I think personally I''d crop it to a 16x9 frame, and see if I could crop away all parts of the bush and tree up front.</td>', 'I feel this has a little too much foreground, it grabs the attention and says "hey I''m important" and takes away from the beautiful stuff behind it.  I think personally I''d crop it to a 16x9 frame, and see if I could crop away all parts of the bush and tree up front.', '2010-11-04 04:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
