(6211239, 916574, 94241, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light.<br/> <br/>I have to admit though, being just slightly off center in a square frame is bugging me.  The square frame seems so formal, so considered.  Then the barn is loosely positioned within that, not enough off center to seem purposeful, just enough to be loose.</td>', 'Gorgeous light. I have to admit though, being just slightly off center in a square frame is bugging me.  The square frame seems so formal, so considered.  Then the barn is loosely positioned within that, not enough off center to seem purposeful, just enough to be loose.', '2010-11-04 04:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
