(6211693, 916687, 108069, '<td valign="top">With a title like that two lovebirds on the bench would have been a nice touch. But regardless it''s a very nice scene. I''ll make a comment on processing only because I''m trying to improve my own. I might have played with levels a bit and run a simple de-noise program on this to make the colors a bit more sharp and contrasty. The exposure could be darker in my opinion, as the top of the bench is blown out a bit. A darker scene would have been a bit moodier... although with the bright leaves that probably wasn''t your intention. <br/> <br/>Of course I just advertised I don''t know what I''m talking about, so maybe scrap all that. Not voting, just making dumb comments.</td>', 'With a title like that two lovebirds on the bench would have been a nice touch. But regardless it''s a very nice scene. I''ll make a comment on processing only because I''m trying to improve my own. I might have played with levels a bit and run a simple de-noise program on this to make the colors a bit more sharp and contrasty. The exposure could be darker in my opinion, as the top of the bench is blown out a bit. A darker scene would have been a bit moodier... although with the bright leaves that probably wasn''t your intention.  Of course I just advertised I don''t know what I''m talking about, so maybe scrap all that. Not voting, just making dumb comments.', '2010-11-04 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
