(6211734, 916047, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2010-11-04 15:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211735, 914580, 65234, '<td valign="top">The man is just dwarfed by the architecture.  Very cool image.</td>', 'The man is just dwarfed by the architecture.  Very cool image.', '2010-11-04 15:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211736, 917459, 65234, '<td valign="top">They''re adorable!  Love the poses :-)</td>', 'They''re adorable!  Love the poses :-)', '2010-11-04 15:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211737, 916960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on that bug.</td>', 'Nice clarity on that bug.', '2010-11-04 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211738, 916587, 27662, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!!', '2010-11-04 15:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211739, 916587, 61961, '<td valign="top">A nearly identical photo just ribboned in the Jump II challenge, so that lessens the impact for me.  And actually I think the other photo has the slight edge.  So no more than a 6 from me. :-)</td>', 'A nearly identical photo just ribboned in the Jump II challenge, so that lessens the impact for me.  And actually I think the other photo has the slight edge.  So no more than a 6 from me. :-)', '2010-11-04 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211741, 917277, 65234, '<td valign="top">The clarity and expression on the lead pigeon is quite extraordinary with those poses and motion blur.  Even without the title my imagination can weave all sorts of stories from this image.  Well done.</td>', 'The clarity and expression on the lead pigeon is quite extraordinary with those poses and motion blur.  Even without the title my imagination can weave all sorts of stories from this image.  Well done.', '2010-11-04 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211743, 917498, 65234, '<td valign="top">Impressive clarity on that Hummer''s ruby throat.</td>', 'Impressive clarity on that Hummer''s ruby throat.', '2010-11-04 15:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211744, 917407, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, he''s kind of cute, even with the dark shadows.</td>', 'Aw, he''s kind of cute, even with the dark shadows.', '2010-11-04 15:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211745, 917305, 65234, '<td valign="top">Virginia Creeper!  One of my favorite weeds to photograph, especially in Autumn.  Nice contrast with the textured wooden fence and I like the shadows.</td>', 'Virginia Creeper!  One of my favorite weeds to photograph, especially in Autumn.  Nice contrast with the textured wooden fence and I like the shadows.', '2010-11-04 15:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211749, 916112, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the powerfil, graceful arch to the neck.</td>', 'Love the powerfil, graceful arch to the neck.', '2010-11-04 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211757, 917467, 19944, '<td valign="top">I gave you what you were clearly looking for.</td>', 'I gave you what you were clearly looking for.', '2010-11-04 15:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211811, 917501, 19944, '<td valign="top">to my eye, there is too much water in the foreground.  I may have tried to get a higher vantage point (if possible) and perhaps try to get more of a reflection of the fall colors in the water.</td>', 'to my eye, there is too much water in the foreground.  I may have tried to get a higher vantage point (if possible) and perhaps try to get more of a reflection of the fall colors in the water.', '2010-11-04 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211812, 916954, 19944, '<td valign="top">I actually think I''d like this better without the log in the front.</td>', 'I actually think I''d like this better without the log in the front.', '2010-11-04 15:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211813, 915578, 19944, '<td valign="top">Not quite a 1.  I gave it a 4.  It''s not a bad photograph, it just offers no appeal to me.</td>', 'Not quite a 1.  I gave it a 4.  It''s not a bad photograph, it just offers no appeal to me.', '2010-11-04 15:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211814, 917496, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like apple fritters.  I just wish this were completely sharp and shot with a wider angle.</td>', 'I like apple fritters.  I just wish this were completely sharp and shot with a wider angle.', '2010-11-04 15:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211815, 915007, 19944, '<td valign="top">This just seems kind of flat to me.</td>', 'This just seems kind of flat to me.', '2010-11-04 15:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211816, 915993, 19944, '<td valign="top">I think you may be on to something here, but not quite there yet.  For me, it seems too flat and colorless</td>', 'I think you may be on to something here, but not quite there yet.  For me, it seems too flat and colorless', '2010-11-04 15:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211817, 914485, 19944, '<td valign="top">I think that if you had shown more water with a reflection of the grasses, this would have been a stronger image.</td>', 'I think that if you had shown more water with a reflection of the grasses, this would have been a stronger image.', '2010-11-04 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211818, 917085, 19944, '<td valign="top">The noise really hurts this</td>', 'The noise really hurts this', '2010-11-04 15:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211819, 916378, 19944, '<td valign="top">In the future, I would try to use the full 800 pixel dimension available to us.  Also, I think the out of focus area in the bottom right hurts this.</td>', 'In the future, I would try to use the full 800 pixel dimension available to us.  Also, I think the out of focus area in the bottom right hurts this.', '2010-11-04 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211822, 912972, 19944, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m looking at here.  all I know is that it really doesn''t hold my interest</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m looking at here.  all I know is that it really doesn''t hold my interest', '2010-11-04 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211823, 917320, 19944, '<td valign="top">The noise really hurts.  If this were better focus and less noisy, you''d have a great shot</td>', 'The noise really hurts.  If this were better focus and less noisy, you''d have a great shot', '2010-11-04 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211824, 912804, 19944, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the ficaria I found on Google.  That ficaria is pleasing to the eye.  This, not so much.</td>', 'This isn''t the ficaria I found on Google.  That ficaria is pleasing to the eye.  This, not so much.', '2010-11-04 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
