(6211972, 916737, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice; really like the composition here.</td>', 'Nice; really like the composition here.', '2010-11-04 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211985, 916880, 1024, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image, it might haunt my dreams.  There is so much to see here.  I hope voters give it the tome it deserves.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image, it might haunt my dreams.  There is so much to see here.  I hope voters give it the tome it deserves.', '2010-11-04 17:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212063, 916351, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and lighting in this. Fall colors always seem like a great idea but then in execution something goes horribly wrong (at least for me). This is very well done. Great tones, color, mood, and, ultimately, a great photo. Composition is excellent, with the sloping fence adding the extra touch. Nice work.</td>', 'Fantastic colors and lighting in this. Fall colors always seem like a great idea but then in execution something goes horribly wrong (at least for me). This is very well done. Great tones, color, mood, and, ultimately, a great photo. Composition is excellent, with the sloping fence adding the extra touch. Nice work.', '2010-11-04 18:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212065, 916810, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: You stopped and made me look, made me think with this one. As far as I can see this is all about the edit and what an interesting edit it is. Sharpness and blurdom all at once.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: i''m not too convinced by the underpinning image - without the interesting edit I''m not so sure there is too much here to look at.<br/> <br/>Overall: although the edit has interest, I''m not sure the image matches it.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: You stopped and made me look, made me think with this one. As far as I can see this is all about the edit and what an interesting edit it is. Sharpness and blurdom all at once. Critical stuff: i''m not too convinced by the underpinning image - without the interesting edit I''m not so sure there is too much here to look at. Overall: although the edit has interest, I''m not sure the image matches it.', '2010-11-04 18:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212066, 916796, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great pose, good 3/4 portrait. It''s a little hot in the frontal section but it looks like a glow...</td>', 'Great pose, good 3/4 portrait. It''s a little hot in the frontal section but it looks like a glow...', '2010-11-04 18:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212068, 916804, 10785, '<td valign="top">He''ll shoot his eye out! HAHA. Oh, he''s got glasses! Good DoF. the picture tells the story.</td>', 'He''ll shoot his eye out! HAHA. Oh, he''s got glasses! Good DoF. the picture tells the story.', '2010-11-04 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
