(6212184, 917022, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good shot, though not a "wow" shot. However.... it does what was certainly intended to do, and that is to make me crave pancakes. That fulfillment of it''s mission earns it a very high vote from me. Guessing this could be an entry from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=69684" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hajeka</a>, as he''s been doing a lot of food photography lately.</td>', 'A good shot, though not a "wow" shot. However.... it does what was certainly intended to do, and that is to make me crave pancakes. That fulfillment of it''s mission earns it a very high vote from me. Guessing this could be an entry from  Hajeka, as he''s been doing a lot of food photography lately.', '2010-11-04 20:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
