(6213132, 917049, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture.. Well seen. The two women provide a interesting contrast to each other in several ways, in the subject of their attention and in their hair styles for example. But each contribute a splash of color, and that plus the two lamp shades (one just a partial one) create a lovely line of color that carries my eye through the image. Bumping to 9.</td>', 'Lovely capture.. Well seen. The two women provide a interesting contrast to each other in several ways, in the subject of their attention and in their hair styles for example. But each contribute a splash of color, and that plus the two lamp shades (one just a partial one) create a lovely line of color that carries my eye through the image. Bumping to 9.', '2010-11-05 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
