(6213355, 917360, 19936, '<td valign="top">Otherwise known as the Chain Lakes / Ptarmigan Ridge Trail? Love this area and great use of the steps in the foreground to lead you in.  A bit soft and over use of contrast takes away from the scene a bit, IMHO of course.  Keep at this one though as it is a great area for wonderful landscapes!</td>', 'Otherwise known as the Chain Lakes / Ptarmigan Ridge Trail? Love this area and great use of the steps in the foreground to lead you in.  A bit soft and over use of contrast takes away from the scene a bit, IMHO of course.  Keep at this one though as it is a great area for wonderful landscapes!', '2010-11-05 22:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
