(6214034, 912497, 18367, '<td valign="top">I am ever so envious.  I have searched high and low around these parts and simply cannot find any of these. Great capture, nice post processing. Hope you do well.</td>', 'I am ever so envious.  I have searched high and low around these parts and simply cannot find any of these. Great capture, nice post processing. Hope you do well.', '2010-11-06 20:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214070, 915382, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a beautifully made image. The light, smoke, near silhouette, the tall mic, the amazing stance of the figure, the suggestion of a band name in the background - all make for an image that is very involving indeed. The monochrome treatment works fantastically well too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: There is a minor background artefact showing through the smoke between the mic stand and the wire - given how good this image is, it might have been worth a clone-out to avoid the eye being led here.<br/> <br/>Overall: Really great work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a beautifully made image. The light, smoke, near silhouette, the tall mic, the amazing stance of the figure, the suggestion of a band name in the background - all make for an image that is very involving indeed. The monochrome treatment works fantastically well too. Critical stuff: There is a minor background artefact showing through the smoke between the mic stand and the wire - given how good this image is, it might have been worth a clone-out to avoid the eye being led here. Overall: Really great work.', '2010-11-06 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214089, 914739, 61084, '<td valign="top">I like it. 6</td>', 'I like it. 6', '2010-11-06 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214091, 917364, 61084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Autumn scene. Love the colors obviously, but I also think you nailed the shutter speed and got it just right. 9</td>', 'Beautiful Autumn scene. Love the colors obviously, but I also think you nailed the shutter speed and got it just right. 9', '2010-11-06 21:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214109, 913214, 108857, '<td valign="top">Im not sure if you were going for the reflection on the water, but a polarizing filter would have cut the glare down a bit.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Im not sure if you were going for the reflection on the water, but a polarizing filter would have cut the glare down a bit.  Nice photo.', '2010-11-06 21:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214158, 916970, 108857, '<td valign="top">excellent depth of field.  It might improve if the plant she is holding was a bit more colorful.  I think it would stand out more from the backgroud.  All around a very nice image.</td>', 'excellent depth of field.  It might improve if the plant she is holding was a bit more colorful.  I think it would stand out more from the backgroud.  All around a very nice image.', '2010-11-06 23:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214159, 916617, 108857, '<td valign="top">Very sharp for a bird in flight.  I might have cropped it alittle, the duck seems trapped by the edges of the photo.  Giving it a bit more infront and less behind would probably seem more natural.  One of my favorites for this free study.</td>', 'Very sharp for a bird in flight.  I might have cropped it alittle, the duck seems trapped by the edges of the photo.  Giving it a bit more infront and less behind would probably seem more natural.  One of my favorites for this free study.', '2010-11-06 23:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
