(6214180, 917487, 108857, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 for this free study.  You may want to consider selling this one to a stock photo company.</td>', 'One of my top 3 for this free study.  You may want to consider selling this one to a stock photo company.', '2010-11-06 23:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214221, 917064, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hunting party returns after many days. Krag, Thag and Og have brought home many fat deer and juicy birds. Tribe will eat well this winter. Is good time of year to hunt. Grog is smart and sends hunting party during wildlife challenge.</td>', 'Hunting party returns after many days. Krag, Thag and Og have brought home many fat deer and juicy birds. Tribe will eat well this winter. Is good time of year to hunt. Grog is smart and sends hunting party during wildlife challenge.', '2010-11-06 23:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214247, 915616, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful: forlorn yet brave, like a dying banner.   <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'Very beautiful: forlorn yet brave, like a dying banner.   Thank you.', '2010-11-07 00:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214248, 917116, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very, very good.  Juxtaposed verticals of streaked glass and city structure, and restrained tones: the wilful lack of definition brings more rather than less voice to the image, as is so often the case.  Thank you.</td>', 'Very, very good.  Juxtaposed verticals of streaked glass and city structure, and restrained tones: the wilful lack of definition brings more rather than less voice to the image, as is so often the case.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 00:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214249, 915382, 30364, '<td valign="top">Looks like something Id do, only yours is better.  Very fine orchestration of tones and shadows.  Thank you.</td>', 'Looks like something Id do, only yours is better.  Very fine orchestration of tones and shadows.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 00:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214250, 914922, 30364, '<td valign="top">Superb photograph of an exceptionally handsome and appealing dog.  I like Monty very much, and judging from this image you do as well.  Thank you.</td>', 'Superb photograph of an exceptionally handsome and appealing dog.  I like Monty very much, and judging from this image you do as well.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 00:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214251, 916518, 30364, '<td valign="top">I enjoy looking at this image.  Its deceptively simple, and I have perhaps been seduced into reading more into it than was intended to be there, but isnt that a measure of a good and durable image?  That it is capable of communicating more than is actually depicted?  Capable of inspiring the viewers participation, rather than mere admiration?  Well, I believe that, and for that reason I liked this photograph very much.  Thank you.</td>', 'I enjoy looking at this image.  Its deceptively simple, and I have perhaps been seduced into reading more into it than was intended to be there, but isnt that a measure of a good and durable image?  That it is capable of communicating more than is actually depicted?  Capable of inspiring the viewers participation, rather than mere admiration?  Well, I believe that, and for that reason I liked this photograph very much.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 00:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214252, 916112, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very lovely image.  Not really to my own eccentric taste, but nevertheless even I can see that this is superb in every way.  Its rare that I like a photograph solely on the basis of whats in the frame and how well its been rendered, so this is an exception for me, which makes it all the more welcome. Thank you.</td>', 'Very lovely image.  Not really to my own eccentric taste, but nevertheless even I can see that this is superb in every way.  Its rare that I like a photograph solely on the basis of whats in the frame and how well its been rendered, so this is an exception for me, which makes it all the more welcome. Thank you.', '2010-11-07 01:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214253, 916819, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I like the weight of it, and the lack of weight: lightness of being.  There is an eye there, at upper left, surely?  A molten vision, deliquescent.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely.  I like the weight of it, and the lack of weight: lightness of being.  There is an eye there, at upper left, surely?  A molten vision, deliquescent.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 01:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214254, 915944, 30364, '<td valign="top">My first thought was of Cormac McCarthy.  Its spare yet rich and visceral like McCarthys prose, though I suppose his colors would be more bleak.  A very fine photograph.  Thank you.</td>', 'My first thought was of Cormac McCarthy.  Its spare yet rich and visceral like McCarthys prose, though I suppose his colors would be more bleak.  A very fine photograph.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 01:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214256, 916626, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such a perfect juxtaposition: simple, eloquent, irresistible.  Thank you.</td>', 'Such a perfect juxtaposition: simple, eloquent, irresistible.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 01:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214258, 916725, 30364, '<td valign="top">An interesting and pleasing photograph.  Irresistibly evocative:  Who are the owners of the bikes? What are they harvesting?  What will they eat for lunch?  What do they talk about, laugh about, while they work?  What paths do they each take, at the end of day?  I love images that invite me outside the frame.  All that, and its beautiful too!  Top three pick for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'An interesting and pleasing photograph.  Irresistibly evocative:  Who are the owners of the bikes? What are they harvesting?  What will they eat for lunch?  What do they talk about, laugh about, while they work?  What paths do they each take, at the end of day?  I love images that invite me outside the frame.  All that, and its beautiful too!  Top three pick for me.  Thank you.', '2010-11-07 01:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214259, 917277, 30364, '<td valign="top">Its a rare treat for me to be able to comment with enthusiasm on an image that is surely going to finish in the ribbons.  Im usually scrounging about down at the other end.  <br/> <br/>Its perfect of course, and the titular reference is also perfect.  Nothing more to say really, except thank you.  Its my second-to-top pick.</td>', 'Its a rare treat for me to be able to comment with enthusiasm on an image that is surely going to finish in the ribbons.  Im usually scrounging about down at the other end.   Its perfect of course, and the titular reference is also perfect.  Nothing more to say really, except thank you.  Its my second-to-top pick.', '2010-11-07 01:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
