(6214524, 917187, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''ve gotten to the point now where I give all zoo shots a four. Really good ones might get a five -- if I''m feeling generous. This is obvoisuly not a zoo. A park maybe, but I doubt it. These animals appear to be in the wild -- their natural habitat. And, as your title suggest, they look hungry. The background gives the viewer some sense of the vastness of their turf. And the challenge of finding their next meal. <br/> <br/>Exciting and very refreshing. Eight.</td>', 'I''ve gotten to the point now where I give all zoo shots a four. Really good ones might get a five -- if I''m feeling generous. This is obvoisuly not a zoo. A park maybe, but I doubt it. These animals appear to be in the wild -- their natural habitat. And, as your title suggest, they look hungry. The background gives the viewer some sense of the vastness of their turf. And the challenge of finding their next meal.  Exciting and very refreshing. Eight.', '2010-11-07 09:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
