(6214910, 917170, 54645, '<td valign="top">Love the energy in this image. Blue reflects the ocean, I wonder about the dog drowning, and how did that guy get a two wheeled paddle boat? Is it me or is the texting painter about to get clobbered by a falling bucket?</td>', 'Love the energy in this image. Blue reflects the ocean, I wonder about the dog drowning, and how did that guy get a two wheeled paddle boat? Is it me or is the texting painter about to get clobbered by a falling bucket?', '2010-11-07 14:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
