(6215214, 917034, 76335, '<td valign="top">I had to look twice to determine if the baby was a doll or not. Still unsure. A funny snap in any case.</td>', 'I had to look twice to determine if the baby was a doll or not. Still unsure. A funny snap in any case.', '2010-11-07 19:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
