(6215810, 915944, 113591, '<td valign="top">I just have the following to say: <br/> <br/>I don''t like the way you framed the scene with the carport, and think you should have cropped in closer.<br/>-Telephone poles in background. (you cloned out some minor signs, posts and a modern lightpole, but you probably felt the telephone poles gave some context to this rural scene.) <br/> <br/>Just joking, I like the photo very much. <br/> <br/>The colours made me think of those car advertisements in the National Geographic from the 1960''s.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I just have the following to say:  I don''t like the way you framed the scene with the carport, and think you should have cropped in closer.-Telephone poles in background. (you cloned out some minor signs, posts and a modern lightpole, but you probably felt the telephone poles gave some context to this rural scene.)  Just joking, I like the photo very much.  The colours made me think of those car advertisements in the National Geographic from the 1960''s.  ', '2010-11-08 00:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
