(6215955, 916772, 104809, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty neat action shot (great image flow and expression by the surfer), but it''s really the left third of the image that my eye is really attracted to.  There''s amazing detail and subtle color variations in the curve of the wave there that I find supremely pleasing.</td>', 'This is a pretty neat action shot (great image flow and expression by the surfer), but it''s really the left third of the image that my eye is really attracted to.  There''s amazing detail and subtle color variations in the curve of the wave there that I find supremely pleasing.', '2010-11-08 03:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
