(6215969, 916772, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wahoooo! &lt;-- that''s what I''d be saying if I was on the surfboard.<br/> <br/>Yipeeeeeee! &lt;-- That''s what I am saying in response to your awesome image and the well deserved ribbon. :-)</td>', 'Wahoooo! <-- that''s what I''d be saying if I was on the surfboard. Yipeeeeeee! <-- That''s what I am saying in response to your awesome image and the well deserved ribbon. :-)', '2010-11-08 04:00:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6215971, 916737, 114682, '<td valign="top">Hi! I was sure it was you again! The astonishingly beautiful capture in the bridge challenge was VERY similar to this one, I just supposed it was the same bridge. The first one has somehow more interesting composition and more colour nuances, but the second one work''s great too. And I think that those 2 walkers on the bridge just give it more human feel and perspective. Whitout them the bridge woud seem too metallic and abstract. Congratulations on high score and great images!</td>', 'Hi! I was sure it was you again! The astonishingly beautiful capture in the bridge challenge was VERY similar to this one, I just supposed it was the same bridge. The first one has somehow more interesting composition and more colour nuances, but the second one work''s great too. And I think that those 2 walkers on the bridge just give it more human feel and perspective. Whitout them the bridge woud seem too metallic and abstract. Congratulations on high score and great images!', '2010-11-08 04:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6215974, 916033, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by albc28:</b></div><hr/><i> it''s not really aesthetically appeasing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Anthony...that has to be my favourite comment ever! I''m sure it''s a typo but i''d like to keep it as it is please!</td>', 'Originally posted by albc28: it''s not really aesthetically appeasing.   Thanks Anthony...that has to be my favourite comment ever! I''m sure it''s a typo but i''d like to keep it as it is please!', '2010-11-08 04:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
