(6216013, 917182, 25024, '<td valign="top">I love the unconventional approach with this shot and hoped (as I''m sure you did) that it would place higher but I think paulbtlw has summed it up well, a great shot. Its the sort of shot that was never going to be in everyone''s taste so good on yer for going for it, well done.</td>', 'I love the unconventional approach with this shot and hoped (as I''m sure you did) that it would place higher but I think paulbtlw has summed it up well, a great shot. Its the sort of shot that was never going to be in everyone''s taste so good on yer for going for it, well done.', '2010-11-08 05:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
