(6216149, 917260, 114233, '<td valign="top">Great capture of an ominous scene. Those are some serious clouds and the drama and power has been captured very well. I''m sure it was even more impressive in real life but I''m glad you shared it with us!<br/>Great colours</td>', 'Great capture of an ominous scene. Those are some serious clouds and the drama and power has been captured very well. I''m sure it was even more impressive in real life but I''m glad you shared it with us!Great colours', '2010-11-08 08:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
