(6216157, 917452, 19944, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the 4th, Neil.  I gave you an 8.  Had I given you only a 7, our positions would have been reversed.  But, lucky for you, you deserved an 8.  This is simply stunning.  I can feel the flow of the water.</td>', 'Congrats on the 4th, Neil.  I gave you an 8.  Had I given you only a 7, our positions would have been reversed.  But, lucky for you, you deserved an 8.  This is simply stunning.  I can feel the flow of the water.', '2010-11-08 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
