(6216612, 917170, 30861, '<td valign="top">One LOVES the not-visible dog and the truncated bike. One LOVES the workman wondering WTF you''re shooting, and why. One LOVES that the bucket has no readily-discernible means of support, such that one can easily imagine it is caught in mid-plummet, the whole world going on about its business as the instant of impact looms. One LOVES the mysterious, gooseneck, ET-like shadow that has no visible source.<br/> <br/>One LOVES this image :-)</td>', 'One LOVES the not-visible dog and the truncated bike. One LOVES the workman wondering WTF you''re shooting, and why. One LOVES that the bucket has no readily-discernible means of support, such that one can easily imagine it is caught in mid-plummet, the whole world going on about its business as the instant of impact looms. One LOVES the mysterious, gooseneck, ET-like shadow that has no visible source. One LOVES this image :-)', '2010-11-08 14:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
