(6217410, 914323, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jekershner7:</b></div><hr/><i> thanks for the great comments everyone! I ALMOST got a 6+ score. would''ve been my first (of my limited entries). <br/> <br/>the parade had just started, so I think she was still in marching band shock mode. I liked the moment.<br/> <br/>@ <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100393" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paulbtlw</a> - appreciate the kind words about the image. I was inspired to get onto 1x.com and upload the photo. unfortunately it wasn''t published. maybe next time. it''s a great site. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m glad you gave it ago. I''m surprised it didn''t hit the mark. I''d have given it high marks in member screening had I come across it.</td>', 'Originally posted by jekershner7: thanks for the great comments everyone! I ALMOST got a 6+ score. would''ve been my first (of my limited entries).  the parade had just started, so I think she was still in marching band shock mode. I liked the moment. @  paulbtlw - appreciate the kind words about the image. I was inspired to get onto 1x.com and upload the photo. unfortunately it wasn''t published. maybe next time. it''s a great site.   I''m glad you gave it ago. I''m surprised it didn''t hit the mark. I''d have given it high marks in member screening had I come across it.', '2010-11-09 08:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
