(6219228, 916586, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, Richard. The luminosity in the red/yellow range is exceptionally well handled. For my tastes, the sky''s a little less so; it seems a bit flat &amp; dark to me, but that''s pretty much a personal, aesthetic judgment; I''m sure others would disagree. And those same others might find my skys-with-gradients entirely overdone :-)<br/> <br/>Lovely shot!</td>', 'Very nicely done, Richard. The luminosity in the red/yellow range is exceptionally well handled. For my tastes, the sky''s a little less so; it seems a bit flat & dark to me, but that''s pretty much a personal, aesthetic judgment; I''m sure others would disagree. And those same others might find my skys-with-gradients entirely overdone :-) Lovely shot!', '2010-11-10 18:01:38.000000', NULL, 0),
