(6219553, 917265, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Aleema:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice textures but im not sure i love it, i think its the either the lack of detail in the mountains or maybe the boat taking away from the naturalness of the scene ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, the boat is the main subject of my photograph as the title suggests, therefore I have given extra treatment to it.  As for the details in the mountains, I agree, however there was nothing I could have done since there was a strong haze covering them.</td>', 'Originally posted by Aleema: Very nice textures but im not sure i love it, i think its the either the lack of detail in the mountains or maybe the boat taking away from the naturalness of the scene ?   Well, the boat is the main subject of my photograph as the title suggests, therefore I have given extra treatment to it.  As for the details in the mountains, I agree, however there was nothing I could have done since there was a strong haze covering them.', '2010-11-10 23:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
