(6227340, 917364, 115644, '<td valign="top">This would have done pretty well at the last reflections challenge :) i gave this a 9 and it was one of the more memorable pictures from this FS. I''m suprised it didn''t go higher. I actually think it''s perfect without rotation -- it splits into three triangles/trapezoids - trees glass and water. it''s actually very centered from this perspective.</td>', 'This would have done pretty well at the last reflections challenge :) i gave this a 9 and it was one of the more memorable pictures from this FS. I''m suprised it didn''t go higher. I actually think it''s perfect without rotation -- it splits into three triangles/trapezoids - trees glass and water. it''s actually very centered from this perspective.', '2010-11-18 22:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
