(6230749, 917452, 86340, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, and a great water flow. Whenever I''ve been there it''s usually a thin stream. I like where you took this from also, and your lens choice. Your signature water motion blur is also present. Unfortunately, for me going to this place brings bad memories as the last time I was there a man committed suicide right after I packed up my tripod and headed back towards the parking lot. What a bummer.</td>', 'This is beautiful, and a great water flow. Whenever I''ve been there it''s usually a thin stream. I like where you took this from also, and your lens choice. Your signature water motion blur is also present. Unfortunately, for me going to this place brings bad memories as the last time I was there a man committed suicide right after I packed up my tripod and headed back towards the parking lot. What a bummer.', '2010-11-23 07:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231443, 915747, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. Moment in time you can never capture again. Beautifully composed with the line leading you in towards the car. I would have cropped off most of the bright sky just above the mountains to concentrate on the beautiful scene in the fog. Favourite for sure.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. Moment in time you can never capture again. Beautifully composed with the line leading you in towards the car. I would have cropped off most of the bright sky just above the mountains to concentrate on the beautiful scene in the fog. Favourite for sure.', '2010-11-23 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
